@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 250

title Création d'un commentaire et mise à jour en temps réel via SSE

actor "Utilisateur" as User
participant "PostCommentComponent\n(Frontend)" as PostCommentComp
participant "PostService\n(Frontend)" as PostServiceFront
participant "CommentEventService\n(Frontend)" as CommentEventService
participant "PostController\n(Backend)" as PostController
participant "PostFacade\n(Backend)" as PostFacade
participant "PostCommentService\n(Backend)" as PostCommentService
participant "AuthFacade\n(Backend)" as AuthFacade
participant "PostRepository\n(Backend)" as PostRepo
participant "CommentRepository\n(Backend)" as CommentRepo
participant "UserRepository\n(Backend)" as UserRepo
participant "CommentEmitter\n(Backend)" as CommentEmitter
participant "SseController\n(Backend)" as SseController
participant "Base de données\n(PostgreSQL/R2DBC)" as DB
actor "Autres Utilisateurs" as OtherUsers

== Initialisation de la connexion SSE ==

User -> PostCommentComp: Chargement de la page de commentaires
activate PostCommentComp
PostCommentComp -> CommentEventService: Initialisation
activate CommentEventService
CommentEventService -> SseController: Connexion au flux SSE\n(GET /api/comments/stream)
activate SseController
SseController -> CommentEmitter: getCommentStream()
activate CommentEmitter
CommentEmitter --> SseController: Flux<PostCommentDto>
SseController --> CommentEventService: Connexion SSE établie
note right of CommentEventService: La connexion SSE reste ouverte\npour recevoir les mises à jour
deactivate CommentEmitter

== Création d'un nouveau commentaire ==

User -> PostCommentComp: Remplit le formulaire et clique sur "Commenter"
PostCommentComp -> PostCommentComp: Validation du formulaire
PostCommentComp -> PostServiceFront: createComment(newComment: PostCommentDto)
activate PostServiceFront
PostServiceFront -> PostController: HTTP POST /api/comments
activate PostController
PostController -> PostFacade: createComment(commentDto)
activate PostFacade
PostFacade -> PostCommentService: createComment(commentDto)
activate PostCommentService

PostCommentService -> AuthFacade: getAuthenticatedUserId()
activate AuthFacade
AuthFacade --> PostCommentService: userId
deactivate AuthFacade

PostCommentService -> PostCommentService: commentMapper.commentDtoToComment(commentDto)
PostCommentService -> PostCommentService: comment.setCreatedBy(userId)

PostCommentService -> PostRepo: findById(commentDto.getPostId())
activate PostRepo
PostRepo -> DB: Requête R2DBC (non-bloquante)
activate DB
DB --> PostRepo: Post
deactivate DB
PostRepo --> PostCommentService: Mono<Post>
deactivate PostRepo

PostCommentService -> CommentRepo: save(comment)
activate CommentRepo
CommentRepo -> DB: Requête SQL INSERT (non-bloquante)
activate DB
note right of DB: Opération asynchrone\nLe thread n'est pas bloqué
DB --> CommentRepo: Résultat
deactivate DB
CommentRepo --> PostCommentService: Mono<PostComment>
deactivate CommentRepo

PostCommentService -> UserRepo: findById(comment.getCreatedBy())
activate UserRepo
UserRepo -> DB: Requête R2DBC (non-bloquante)
activate DB
DB --> UserRepo: User
deactivate DB
UserRepo --> PostCommentService: Mono<User>
deactivate UserRepo

PostCommentService -> PostCommentService: enrichCommentDto(comment)
note right of PostCommentService: Ajoute des informations\nsupplémentaires au DTO\ncomme le nom d'utilisateur

== Diffusion du commentaire via SSE ==

PostCommentService -> CommentEmitter: notifyNewComment(enrichedCommentDto)
activate CommentEmitter
CommentEmitter -> CommentEmitter: commentSink.tryEmitNext(comment)
note right of CommentEmitter: Émet le nouveau commentaire\ndans le Sink réactif
CommentEmitter --> SseController: Notification de nouvelles données
SseController -> SseController: Création d'un ServerSentEvent
SseController --> CommentEventService: Envoi de l'événement "comment-created"
CommentEventService -> CommentEventService: newCommentSubject.next(comment)
deactivate CommentEmitter

PostCommentService -> PostCommentService: postStatisticsService.updateAndNotifyTopicStats()
note right of PostCommentService: Mise à jour des statistiques\ndes topics (nombre de commentaires)

PostCommentService --> PostFacade: PostCommentDto enrichi
deactivate PostCommentService
PostFacade --> PostController: PostCommentDto
deactivate PostFacade
PostController --> PostServiceFront: Réponse HTTP 201 Created
deactivate PostController
PostServiceFront --> PostCommentComp: PostCommentDto
deactivate PostServiceFront

PostCommentComp -> PostCommentComp: Ajout du commentaire à la liste locale
PostCommentComp -> PostCommentComp: Réinitialisation du formulaire
PostCommentComp --> User: Affichage du commentaire ajouté

== Réception du commentaire par les autres utilisateurs ==

CommentEventService --> OtherUsers: Mise à jour de l'interface pour tous les utilisateurs connectés
note right of CommentEventService: Les autres utilisateurs voient\nle nouveau commentaire en temps réel

@enduml
